          "value": "<p>With a few great flaps from its wings, the nelapsi unleashes a swirling blast of wind that seems to cut through the air like blades. As a standard action, the nelapsi can deal 3d6 slashing damage and 3d6 wind damage to all enemies within a 30 ft. cone, three times per day. A successful Reflex save (DC 15) halves both sources of damage.</p>",
